### youtube
ipset=/:.*youtube.*:/youtu.be/ggpht.com/ytimg.com/unblock_youtube
ipset=/yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytimg.l.google.com/unblock_youtube
ipset=/ytstatic.l.google.com/yt-video-upload.l.google.com/unblock_youtube
ipset=/googlevideo.com/unblock_youtube

### twitch
ipset=/twitch.tv/twitchcdn.net/jtvnw.net/ttvnw.net/unblock_twitch
ipset=/ext-twitch.tv/live-video.net/unblock_twitch

### discord
